  "id": "chilaquiles",
  "name": "Chilaquiles",
  "subtitle": "Crisp tortilla chips with smoky tomato sauce and eggs",
  "description": "Charred tomatoes, onion, garlic, and jalapeños form a smoky sauce for tortilla chips, eggs, cheese, avocado, and fresh herbs.",
